      "id": "claim_ed575091d74245b7b8cb14a6d80f64d2",
      "statement": "Djimitflo is an npm-workspaces monorepo whose root package.json declares `\"workspaces\": [\"packages/*\"]`, making every directory under packages/ a workspace; the repo ships seven @djimitflo/* code packages plus packages/knowledge, a runtime-generated data directory that has no package.json and is not built or published.",
