      "statement": "@djimitflo/telegram is an embeddable library (not a standalone process): the server dynamically imports its TelegramGatewayService and injects task/status/cancel ops; the gateway long-polls the Telegram Bot API per configured bot and uses a host-qualified file lease plus heartbeat so only one running instance polls a given bot token.",
