    {
      "id": "claim_78cb26d4c9b54d1faea628bb4354dc82",
      "statement": "The single root package-lock.json plus the root `overrides` block (esbuild, postcss, fast-uri, ip-address, nanoid, brace-expansion@1, qs) is the only place dependency resolution is controlled across all workspaces — per-package lockfiles are git-ignored — so these pins shape every workspace's resolved tree (not the build order) before the chained builds run.",
